        "id": 1003000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-10T20:50:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t it wrong to set this to uint32_t? `ec_response_port80_last_boot` only accepts a uint16_t as code.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 27,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 27,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "14dd51f4fcfeb1bbbdbf0dd9f9365c4072db44ef",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "16b02cce_2a884118",
        "filename": "common/port80.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 63,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-10T20:50:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t we just drop this check completely? It will help keep the behavior consistent across all devices i.e. schedule a deferred call any time there is a new post code irrespective of whether it is \u003c 0x100.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 8,
